==English==

===Alternative spellings===
*[[extemporise]] {{italbrac|mostly Commonwealth}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|extemporiz|ing}}

#{{intransitive}} To do something, particularly to [[perform]] or [[speak]], without [[prior]] [[plan]]ning or [[thought]]; to act in an [[impromptu]] manner; to [[improvise]].

